sequenceDiagram
  actor Customer
  participant Menu as MenuScreen
  participant Cart as CartContext / cartReducer
  participant Summary as OrderSummaryScreen
  participant Orders as OrdersContext / AsyncStorage
  participant Tracking as OrderTrackingScreen
  Customer->>Menu: Tap Add to cart
  Menu->>Cart: dispatch(ADD_ITEM, item)
  Cart-->>Menu: updated item count / badge
  Customer->>Menu: Open Cart and Review order
  Menu->>Summary: Navigate with service mode
  Summary->>Cart: Read items and promo
  Summary->>Summary: useMemo fee/tax/total calculation
  Customer->>Summary: Tap Place order
  Summary->>Orders: dispatch(CREATE, order)
  Orders->>Orders: Persist orders in AsyncStorage
  Summary->>Cart: dispatch(CLEAR_CART)
  Summary->>Tracking: Navigate(orderId)
  Tracking->>Orders: Read order and observe status
  Orders-->>Tracking: Pending order snapshot
  Tracking-->>Customer: Progress and elapsed-time display
